"ctlx, vi, vi-move, vi-command>, and I<vi-insert>.  I<vi> is equivalent to "
"I<vi-command> (I<vi-move> is also a synonym); I<emacs> is equivalent to "
"I<emacs-standard>."
msgstr ""

#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
